<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - RTW Inc raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - RTW Inc raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dain Bosworth Inc said Tuesday it raised RTW Inc to buy from hold, based on price.</p>
<p>--The stock is &quot;down from a mid-summer high of $34 despite a continued positive fundamental outlook at the company,&quot; analyst J. Chris Sergeant wrote in a research report. The stock closed down 1 at 25-3/4 on Nasdaq Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Price target for the next 12-18 months is $36 a share, Sergeant said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
